  "foaf:name": "The Royal College of Art",
  "sdo:name": "The Royal College of Art",
  "sdo:description": "The Royal College of Art&#x27;s vision is to partner with UNESCO and the Ocean Decade to create a world class fit-for-purpose co-design and stakeholder engagement platform. They aim to collaborate, observe, monitor, facilitate, educate, train, network and deploy the best codesign practices.",
